                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.01/36: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Laughlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-22T13:00:00+00:00">April 22, 1931—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 22—11:30 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>28. Your number 12, April 21, 4 p.m. British colleague took action 12:30 today.
                    Minister of Foreign Affairs will receive me at 4:30 this afternoon for delivery
                    of note authorized by you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laughlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
